@FeatureFlags.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5043

### List features
GET {{FeatureFlags.Api_HostAddress}}/api/features

### Create always-on feature
POST {{FeatureFlags.Api_HostAddress}}/api/features/CheckoutV2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "requirementType": "Any",
  "filters": []
}

### Probe enablement
GET {{FeatureFlags.Api_HostAddress}}/api/features/CheckoutV2/enabled

### Update with percentage filter
PUT {{FeatureFlags.Api_HostAddress}}/api/features/CheckoutV2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "requirementType": "Any",
  "filters": [
    {
      "name": "Microsoft.Percentage",
      "parameters": { "Value": 50 }
    }
  ]
}

### Delete feature
DELETE {{FeatureFlags.Api_HostAddress}}/api/features/CheckoutV2
